@startuml
title State machine for Healthcare Portal

state Idle
state Registered
state SignedIn
state AccessGranted
state NewsAndExpertContentAvailable
state HealthInfoAvailable
state PaymentProcessed
state InsuranceChecked
state CashPaymentDetailsProvided
state SessionFinished
state UserFeedbackCollected
state LoggedOut

[*] --> Idle : /new user registration/
Idle --> [*]

Idle --> Registered : successful registration
Registered --> SignedIn : valid login credentials
SignedIn --> AccessGranted : access to facilities granted
AccessGranted --> NewsAndExpertContentAvailable : news and expert content available
NewsAndExpertContentAvailable --> HealthInfoAvailable : health-related information available
HealthInfoAvailable --> PaymentProcessed : payment processed for services
PaymentProcessed --> InsuranceChecked : insurance checked for doctor consultations
InsuranceChecked --> CashPaymentDetailsProvided : cash payment details provided
CashPaymentDetailsProvided --> SessionFinished : session finished after viewing result
SessionFinished --> UserFeedbackCollected : user feedback collected
UserFeedbackCollected --> LoggedOut : logout at end of session

LoggedOut --> [*] : /end of session/

@enduml
